      "system": {
        "description": "<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Bloatfly can move freely through the air. They ignore most ground-level obstacles and difficult terrain effects, and they can move through &ldquo;empty&rdquo; zones above the battlefield if desired. It must spend at least one minor action each turn moving, and if it is knocked prone it falls to the ground, suffering 3 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">CD</span><span class=\"fontstyle2\" style=\"color: #fde635;\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Stun physical damage, +2 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">CD</span><span class=\"fontstyle2\" style=\"color: #fde635;\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">for each zone above ground level it was before it fell.</span></p>",
